Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(mcp): list_features facing follows the facet winding,
 bottom caps read down

The face plane normal is sign-canonical (winding-free), so a bottom cap
shared the top cap's +Z normal and read "up". Flip it to the outward side
from the summed facet winding before reporting normal/facing.

Fixes #884

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL
