From 05a25ccdd08224c5f111caf88d218722c39fb8bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 19:54:36 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(mcp): list_features reads
 pick::align::outward_normal, normal reported where the part sits

Drops #947's second outward() helper; list_features calls the one
outward_normal the WCS picks use (now pub(crate)), which flips to the
facets' outside and turns by the part's placement. A face it refuses
(open or inside-out shell) keeps the canonical normal, placed.

Fixes #956

